## Indoors and out

The same easy comfort as our other studios, with the bonus of your own terrace. Inside there is a comfortable double bed, a walk-in shower and a fully equipped kitchenette with a Nespresso machine. Outside, a private terrace to linger over breakfast or wind down in the evening.
